{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-tool-bridge-patterns","title":"跨工具 bridge 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/hooks/hooks-pitfalls-and-bridges/cross-tool-bridge-patterns","wordCount":1170,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨工具-bridge-模式\">跨工具 bridge 模式</h1><p>团队同时使用 Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 三家工具时，hook 规则的维护成本以&quot;工具数量 × 规则数量&quot;线性增长——同一条&quot;拒绝 force-push 到 main&quot;的策略要在 Claude <code>settings.json</code> 写一份 bash 脚本、在 Codex <code>config.toml</code> 写一份、在 OpenCode 里写一份 TS plugin。社区 issue #12472 的讨论沉淀出&quot;OpenCode plugin 桥接 Claude Code hook&quot;这一事实标准方案，加上工具名映射、exit code 2 re-injection、共享 hook 仓库三种范式，可以把团队 hook 维护收敛到单一信源。本文给出可照搬的 bridge plugin 与 monorepo template。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    SR[共享 hook 仓库 team-hooks/] --&gt; CC[Claude Code]&#10;    SR --&gt; CX[Codex]&#10;    SR --&gt; OC[OpenCode]&#10;    CC --&gt;|~/.claude/settings.json 引用| EXE1[执行 hook 脚本]&#10;    CX --&gt;|~/.codex/config.toml 引用| EXE2[执行 hook 脚本]&#10;    OC --&gt;|bridge plugin 读 settings.json + map 事件| EXE3[plugin 内调 hook 脚本]&#10;    BR[bridge plugin] --&gt; N[工具名转换 Bash&lt;-&gt;bash]&#10;    BR --&gt; E[exit code 2 re-injection 模拟 Stop]&#10;    BR --&gt; M[event mapping]&#10;    M --&gt;|PreToolUse| TB[tool.execute.before]&#10;    M --&gt;|PostToolUse| TA[tool.execute.after]&#10;    M --&gt;|Stop| SI[session.idle]\">flowchart TB\n    SR[共享 hook 仓库 team-hooks/] --&gt; CC[Claude Code]\n    SR --&gt; CX[Codex]\n    SR --&gt; OC[OpenCode]\n    CC --&gt;|~/.claude/settings.json 引用| EXE1[执行 hook 脚本]\n    CX --&gt;|~/.codex/config.toml 引用| EXE2[执行 hook 脚本]\n    OC --&gt;|bridge plugin 读 settings.json + map 事件| EXE3[plugin 内调 hook 脚本]\n    BR[bridge plugin] --&gt; N[工具名转换 Bash&lt;-&gt;bash]\n    BR --&gt; E[exit code 2 re-injection 模拟 Stop]\n    BR --&gt; M[event mapping]\n    M --&gt;|PreToolUse| TB[tool.execute.before]\n    M --&gt;|PostToolUse| TA[tool.execute.after]\n    M --&gt;|Stop| SI[session.idle]</pre><p>bridge 的核心思路：把 hook 脚本仍然按 Claude Code 的协议（stdin JSON、exit code）写，存到一个共享仓库；Claude Code 通过 <code>settings.json</code> 直接引用；Codex 通过 <code>config.toml</code> 引用同一份脚本（协议兼容）；OpenCode 写一个 bridge plugin，启动时扫 <code>~/.claude/settings.json</code> 把 hooks 数组 map 到 OpenCode 三类 plugin event、动态调脚本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>hook 来源</th>\n<th>桥接难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Claude Code</td>\n<td><code>settings.json</code> 引用脚本（原生）</td>\n<td>低（信源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Codex</td>\n<td><code>config.toml</code> 引用同一脚本</td>\n<td>低（协议一致）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenCode</td>\n<td>bridge plugin 读 settings.json</td>\n<td>中（需写 plugin）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opencode-bridge-plugin-从-settings-json-到-plugin-event\">OpenCode bridge plugin：从 settings.json 到 plugin event</h2><p>bridge plugin 启动时读 <code>~/.claude/settings.json</code>，把 <code>hooks</code> 字段 map 到 OpenCode 的三个 plugin event。下面是简化版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// opencode-plugin-claude-hooks-bridge/index.ts&#10;import { readFileSync } from &#39;fs&#39;;&#10;import { homedir } from &#39;os&#39;;&#10;import { join } from &#39;path&#39;;&#10;import { spawnSync } from &#39;child_process&#39;;&#10;import type { Plugin } from &#39;opencode-plugin-types&#39;;&#10;&#10;type ClaudeHook = {&#10;  matcher?: string;&#10;  command?: string;&#10;  timeout_ms?: number;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type Settings = { hooks?: Record&lt;string, ClaudeHook[]&gt; };&#10;&#10;const EVENT_MAP: Record&lt;string, &#39;tool.execute.before&#39; | &#39;tool.execute.after&#39; | &#39;session.idle&#39;&gt; = {&#10;  PreToolUse: &#39;tool.execute.before&#39;,&#10;  PostToolUse: &#39;tool.execute.after&#39;,&#10;  Stop: &#39;session.idle&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const TOOL_NAME_MAP: Record&lt;string, string&gt; = {&#10;  bash: &#39;Bash&#39;,&#10;  edit: &#39;Edit&#39;,&#10;  read: &#39;Read&#39;,&#10;  write: &#39;Write&#39;,&#10;  grep: &#39;Grep&#39;,&#10;  glob: &#39;Glob&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;function normalizeToolName(name: string) {&#10;  return TOOL_NAME_MAP[name.toLowerCase()] ?? name;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function loadSettings(): Settings {&#10;  try {&#10;    return JSON.parse(readFileSync(join(homedir(), &#39;.claude/settings.json&#39;), &#39;utf8&#39;));&#10;  } catch {&#10;    return {};&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function runHook(hook: ClaudeHook, eventPayload: object) {&#10;  const result = spawnSync(hook.command!, [], {&#10;    input: JSON.stringify(eventPayload),&#10;    encoding: &#39;utf8&#39;,&#10;    timeout: hook.timeout_ms ?? 2000,&#10;    shell: true,&#10;  });&#10;  return {&#10;    exitCode: result.status ?? 0,&#10;    stdout: result.stdout ?? &#39;&#39;,&#10;    stderr: result.stderr ?? &#39;&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const plugin: Plugin = {&#10;  name: &#39;claude-hooks-bridge&#39;,&#10;  version: &#39;1.0.0&#39;,&#10;&#10;  async onEnable(ctx) {&#10;    const settings = loadSettings();&#10;    ctx.log.info(`bridge: 加载 ${Object.keys(settings.hooks ?? {}).length} 个事件 hook`);&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  hooks: {&#10;    &#39;tool.execute.before&#39;: async (event, ctx) =&gt; {&#10;      const hooks = loadSettings().hooks?.PreToolUse ?? [];&#10;      const toolName = normalizeToolName(event.tool);&#10;      for (const h of hooks) {&#10;        if (h.matcher &amp;&amp; !new RegExp(h.matcher).test(toolName)) continue;&#10;        const r = runHook(h, { tool_name: toolName, tool_input: event.input });&#10;        if (r.exitCode === 2) {&#10;          return { decision: &#39;deny&#39;, reason: r.stderr.trim() };&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;&#10;    &#39;tool.execute.after&#39;: async (event, ctx) =&gt; {&#10;      const hooks = loadSettings().hooks?.PostToolUse ?? [];&#10;      const toolName = normalizeToolName(event.tool);&#10;      for (const h of hooks) {&#10;        if (h.matcher &amp;&amp; !new RegExp(h.matcher).test(toolName)) continue;&#10;        runHook(h, { tool_name: toolName, tool_output: event.output });&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;&#10;    &#39;session.idle&#39;: async (event, ctx) =&gt; {&#10;      if (event.cause !== &#39;agent_stop&#39;) return;&#10;      const hooks = loadSettings().hooks?.Stop ?? [];&#10;      for (const h of hooks) {&#10;        const r = runHook(h, { cause: event.cause });&#10;        if (r.exitCode === 2) {&#10;          return { decision: &#39;continue&#39;, message: r.stderr.trim() };&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default plugin;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// opencode-plugin-claude-hooks-bridge/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFileSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { homedir } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'os'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { join } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'path'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { spawnSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'child_process'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Plugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'opencode-plugin-types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClaudeHook</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  matcher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeout_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Settings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hooks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ClaudeHook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EVENT_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tool.execute.before'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tool.execute.after'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session.idle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PreToolUse: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tool.execute.before'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PostToolUse: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tool.execute.after'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Stop: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'session.idle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TOOL_NAME_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bash: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  edit: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Edit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  read: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span styl